id: what_we_heard
----
## Ideas we heard

Our poll asked people what they’d like government to do about the impact of AI. We got a wide range of ideas for policies.
----
id: word_cloud
chart_alt: "Word cloud of the most common words in poll responses."
placeholder_label: "Word cloud visualization (placeholder)"
----

----
id: ranking
----
Then we refined those ideas in 2-hour discussions. We grouped what people said in these discussions into 27 distinct ideas. Then we ranked them according to:

- How often an idea came up across discussions (frequency), and
- How much support it drew when it did (how often it was a popular idea).

That ranking sorted the concepts into these three tiers:
